      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 100\n    coupon_rate = 0.08\n    coupon_payment = face_value * coupon_rate\n    spot_rates = [0.07, 0.08, 0.09]\n\n    # Discount each annual cash flow using its corresponding spot rate\n    bond_price = sum(\n        coupon_payment / (1 + spot_rates[year - 1]) ** year\n        for year in range(1, 4)\n    )\n    bond_price += face_value / (1 + spot_rates[2]) ** 3\n\n    # Return the price rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(bond_price, 3)\n```",
